  {
    "id": 1006003090010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "お疲れ様、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ。ちょっと見てほしいオファーの資料があるんだ\r\n悪いけど、車の中で目を通してくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、了解したよ\r\nこちらこそ、時間に余裕を持てなくてすまないね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "謝ることなんて何もないさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そうだ、咲耶宛のファンレター、\r\n今日の仕事の後に渡すよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう！　フフ、そんなご褒美があれば、\r\nいつも以上の気合が入ってしまうな",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……彼女、からのものは…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………今回も、なかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そうか、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まあ、都合が良すぎるだろうね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "彼女の願いに何も応えられていないのに、\r\nまた手紙を送ってきてほしいと思うなんて",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もう私のことは、視界の隅にすら入ってないかもしれない\r\n彼女の心を満たすものは、もう別の何かかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──そうであるべきなんだ\r\n彼女を裏切った私のことなど……忘れて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090100"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………けれど……\r\nけれど、もし、叶うならば…………",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いつか、偶然でも構わない、あの子がまた私を目にし、\r\nその時の私が、彼女の望むものであったなら──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "その時は、また────",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………\r\n………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………\r\n………………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………フフ\r\nなんて、夢物語もいいところだね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090150"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00302",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………道、今日も混んでいるね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、回り道か……\r\n高速を使うのもありだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえば前に渋滞をよけて通った小道、\r\nなかなか空いてたな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それなら、その道を使ってみたいな\r\n間に合いそうなら、どうだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "了解した\r\nそこの横道に入るぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0345",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 5000
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……道はひとつではないんだ\r\n色んな道を進むのも、また楽しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "どんな道を選んでも……\r\nきっと最後は望む場所に、たどりつける",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の選択は、きっと最良だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、そうだな\r\n咲耶なら大丈夫だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………フフ\r\nそれはきっと、アナタが…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090210"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00129",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──さて、話してばかりもいられないね\r\n目を通す資料はこれかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、口でも簡単に説明するよ\r\n──ちょうど今、ふたつのオファーが来ている",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとつめは、ウェブ放送のバラエティ番組だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かなり突っ込んだ話をすることが多い\r\nプライベートについても聞かれるだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………\r\n………………………………",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もうひとつは、新ブランドの発表会でのモデルだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのオーディションに参加しないかって、\r\n先方から声がかかっている",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………\r\n………………………………",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうする？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………フフ、\r\nそんなの聞くまでもない",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600309/1006003090250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003090260,
